ub.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/105385","id":2825306529,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6oZsGh","user":{"login":"TokageItLab","id":61938263,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYxOTM4MjYz","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/61938263?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab","html_url":"https://github.com/TokageItLab","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-04-23T19:22:04Z","updated_at":"2025-04-23T19:22:04Z","body":"> If I'm not mistaken, looking at the previous keyframe should be enough for nearest interpolation. I implemented it this way as a workaround for our project, by skipping the builtin optimizer and that works great.\n\n> Of course, then the reverse playback needs to be aware of reading the correct key. But that's something that needs to happen for nearest interpolation regardless.\n\nYou are right. However, in my opinion the current nearest interpolation backward seems to be broken on the position/rotation/scale 3d & blendshape tracks (it should be handled correctly on the value track). So I have sent a fix as https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/105694. When this is applied, it should make sense to compare 3 keys instead of 2 to make the forward and reverse playback results consistent.","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2825306529/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]